      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helsing%C3%B8r",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Wiibroe brewery, founded in 1840, was Denmark’s second brewery to ship bottled beer, just three years after Carlsberg.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
